&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE OpenQuerySequencia DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE OpenQuerySequencia :
OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} EXCLUSIVE-LOCK
    WHERE {&TableName}.periodo  >= v-periodo-ini
      AND {&TableName}.periodo  <= v-periodo-fim
      AND {&TableName}.unid-neg >= v-unid-neg-ini
      AND {&TableName}.unid-neg <= v-unid-neg-fim
      AND {&TableName}.segmento >= v-segmento-ini
      AND {&TableName}.segmento <= v-segmento-fim.
    
    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

